nter Rise. As a hunter, you explore new maps, learn how each creature behaves and take it on with a choice of fourteen weapon types, then collect rewards from successful hunts to improve your gear.\n\nThe roster mixes returning monsters with new ones inspired by Japanese folklore, led by the wyvern Magnamalo, and a new storyline frames the hunts. You can play alone or team up in online co-op. The PC version adds visual and performance improvements. It suits players who enjoy learning enemy patterns and improving through repeated hunts."}}